[38;2;124;124;124mv_\mathfrak{p}((a)))$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mFor $\mathfrak{p}$ to appear in the factorization of $(I, a)$, we need [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$v_\mathfrak{p}(I + (a)) > 0$, i.e., $\min(v_\mathfrak{p}(I), v_\mathfrak{p}[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m((a))) > 0$, i.e., both $v_\mathfrak{p}(I) > 0$ and $v_\mathfrak{p}((a)) > 0$.[0m

